  "details": "- CVE-2026-11972: stop tarfile._Stream.seek() looping over the declared block\n  count once the stream is at EOF, so a crafted header advertising a huge\n  member size can no longer make a streaming-mode read take exponentially longer\n- CVE-2026-9669: latch the libbz2 error in BZ2Decompressor and refuse further\n  use with ValueError, so an application that retries a decompressor after an\n  OSError can no longer re-enter BZ2_bzDecompress() on invalid internal state\n  and drive out-of-bounds writes to a stack buffer",
